              "slug": "response-to-the-pauline-epistle",
              "title": "Response to the Pauline Epistle (Coptic)",
              "note": "(Pi-ehmot ghar)",
              "sort": 10,
              "published": true,
              "recordings": [],
              "segments": [
                {
                  "t": "0:00",
                  "texts": {
                    "en": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ, be with your saintly spirit, my lord the honored father the high priest Papa Abba (...).",
                    "cop": "Pi`hmot jar `mpeno̅c̅ I3̅c̅ Px̅c̅: e4`e2wpi nem pek`ajion `pnevma: pao̅c̅ `niwt ettai3ovt `n`arx3`erevc papa abba (...)",
                    "cop_en": "Pi ehmot ghar em-pen-choice Isos pi khristos: ef-e-shoapi nem pek-agion ep-nevma: pa-choice en-yot et-ta-yoat en-arshi-erevs papa avva (...)"
                  },
                  "sort": 10,
                  "published": true
                },
                {
                  "t": "0:00",
                  "texts": {
                    "en": "And our father the Bishop Abba (...)",
                    "cop": "Nem peniwt `n`epickopoc abba (...).",
                    "cop_en": "nem pen yoat en-e-piskopos avva (...)"
                  },
                  "sort": 20,
                  "published": true
                },
                {
                  "t": "0:00",
                  "texts": {
                    "en": "May the clergy and all the people be safe in the Lord. Amen. So it shall be.",
